  "body": "\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-fill\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-background-color has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"https://hokkienlang.wordpress.com/zh-tw/\">繁體中文</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-fill\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-bright-blue-background-color has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"https://hokkienlang.wordpress.com/zh-cn/\">简体中文</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">TheHokkienLang is a space for exploring <strong>Hokkien</strong> through <strong>Tangliengim</strong> — a writing system designed to make Hokkien pronunciation, tones, and sound changes easier to visualise.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why Tangliengim?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Hokkien is spoken by more than 25 million people worldwide, yet remains under-represented in everyday writing. <strong>Hanri </strong>(<strong><span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">漢字<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">한`띠ˉ</rt></ruby></span></strong>), or Chinese characters read through Hokkien, preserves meaning and lexical identity, but does not always make pronunciation clear. Romanisation shows pronunciation well, but sits outside the character-based writing tradition shared across East Asia.</p>\n\n\n\n<img src=\"/assets/content/wordpress/458d8131d783-vowels-illustration.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3034\" style=\"width:125px;height:auto;float:right\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/learn/introduction/\"><strong>Tangliengim</strong></a> (<strong><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">東寧音<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.1em;left: 0.8em\">당ˉ롕임ˆ</rt></ruby></strong>) bridges these two functions.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Built on Hangul, Tangliengim uses phonetic blocks to represent Hokkien syllables, tones, and tone sandhi. It is designed primarily for <strong>Hanri–Hangul mixed writing</strong>: Hanri carries lexical meaning, while Hangul makes pronunciation explicit where useful. Pure Hangul remains available when fully phonetic writing is needed (e.g., in education).</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Same blocks, different sounds</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Take the word <strong>“student”</strong>:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\">In Korean: <strong>학생</strong> (<em>hak-saeng</em>)</li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\">In Hokkien (written with Tangliengim): <strong><span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">學生<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.72em\">학솅ˆ</rt></ruby></span></strong> (<em>hak-siêng</em>)</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">The blocks may look familiar, but the sound system is Hokkien. Tangliengim adapts Hangul’s syllable-based design to Hokkien phonology, especially its <strong>tones and tone sandhi</strong>, while working naturally alongside Hanri.</p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 2em\"></div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity is-style-default\">\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Learn Tangliengim</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-fe48e5de wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-fill\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-medium-blue-background-color has-background has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"/learn/introduction/\">Start learning in English</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-background-color has-background has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"https://hokkienlang.wordpress.com/zh-tw-tangliengim/\">以中文（繁）開始學習</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-fill\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-bright-blue-background-color has-background has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"https://hokkienlang.wordpress.com/zh-cn-tangliengim/\">以中文（简）开始学习</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 2em\"></div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity is-style-default\">\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Guide to Hokkien tone sandhi</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Ready to go deeper?<br>Discover the tone-sandhi patterns that give Hokkien its distinctive rhythm.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-fe48e5de wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--15\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-medium-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"/learn/tone-sandhi/\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\">Tone sandhi in&nbsp;Hokkien</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 2em\"></div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\">\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Literature works</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover has-small-font-size wp-duotone-unset-16\" style=\"min-height:430px;aspect-ratio:unset;\"><img data-attachment-id=\"3032\" data-permalink=\"https://hokkienlang.wordpress.com/the-egg/\" data-orig-file=\"https://hokkienlang.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/the-egg.png\" data-orig-size=\"707,841\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Egg\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://hokkienlang.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/the-egg.png?w=707\" data-cover-min-height=\"430\" class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-3032\" alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/content/wordpress/a544aeacfa20-the-egg.png\" data-object-fit=\"cover\" loading=\"lazy\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-60 has-background-dim\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-cover-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-white-color has-text-color has-link-color has-large-font-size wp-elements-5 wp-block-paragraph\"><b><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"nn̄g\"><a href=\"/read/stories/the-egg/\">卵<rt style=\"font-size: 50%;position: absolute;top: -1.4em;left: 0.4em\">능ˉ</rt></a></ruby></b></p>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" data-attachment-id=\"7199\" data-permalink=\"https://hokkienlang.wordpress.com/%e7%9b%ae%e9%8c%84-directory/naikiengki/\" data-orig-file=\"https://hokkienlang.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/naikiengki.png\" data-orig-size=\"1024,1024\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"naikiengki\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://hokkienlang.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/naikiengki.png?w=1024\" class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-7199 size-large\" alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/content/wordpress/c9a8f25fedf3-naikiengki.png\" data-object-fit=\"cover\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-60 has-background-dim\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-cover-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-white-color has-text-color has-link-color has-large-font-size wp-elements-6 wp-block-paragraph\"><b><a href=\"/read/literature/lychee-mirror/\" title=\"荔鏡記\"><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"nai-kièng-ki\">荔鏡記<rt style=\"font-size: 50%;position: absolute;top: -1.4em;left: 1.6em\">내곙`기</rt></ruby></a></b><span style=\"display: inline-block;text-align: center;width: 100%;font-size: 0.5em\">(Under construction)</span></p>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"margin-top: 2em\"></div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity is-style-default\">\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Songs</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-pullquote has-medium-font-size\"><blockquote><p><em>From timeless classics to emerging new bands, this collection brings together ballads from Taiwan and Southeast Asia, with each warm melody gently embracing the many emotions life brings.</em></p></blockquote></figure>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"margin-top: 2em\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Modern &amp; Contemporary</h3>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-left is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-63375db1 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-color has-pale-ocean-gradient-background has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-element-button\" href=\"https://hokkienlang.wordpress.com/2025/07/09/向前走-형졩걀-諺文歌詞/\"><span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\"><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">向前走</span><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">Hiòng-jien-kiá̰</span></span></a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-color has-pale-ocean-gradient-background has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/浪溜嗹/\"><span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\"><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">浪流連</span><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">Long-liû-liên</span></span></a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-color has-pale-ocean-gradient-background has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/敢傻敢衝/\"><span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\"><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">敢傻敢衝</span><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">Gǎn shǎ gǎn chōng</span></span></a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-color has-pale-ocean-gradient-background has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/곻愛릐一擺/\"><span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\"><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">閣愛妳一擺</span><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">Kôh-ài-lì jit-pài</span></span></a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-color has-pale-ocean-gradient-background has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/헤비運將情歌/\"><span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\"><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">Happy!!! 運將情歌</span><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">Happy!!! Ùn-jiang jieng-koâ</span></span></a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-color has-pale-ocean-gradient-background has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/一吋相思一吋淚/\"><span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\"><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">一吋相思一吋淚</span><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">Jit-chùn-siṵ̄-sî jit-chùn-lūi</span></span></a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-color has-pale-ocean-gradient-background has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/寫一條歌寫릐꽈爾爾/\"><span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\"><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">寫一條歌，寫你我爾爾</span><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">Siâ-jit-tiau-koâ, siâ-lî-goà nia-niā</span></span></a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-color has-pale-ocean-gradient-background has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/愛情릐比꽈想에곻較偉大/\"><span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\"><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">愛情你比我想的閣較偉大</span><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">Ài-jieng-lì pî-goà siṵ̄’e kôh-khâh-wî-tāi</span></span></a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Urban Ballads</h3>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-vivid-cyan-blue-to-vivid-purple-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/門/\"><span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\"><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">門</span><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">Mńg</span></span></a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-vivid-cyan-blue-to-vivid-purple-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/메삐메삐/\">Maybe Maybe</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-fill\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-vivid-cyan-blue-to-vivid-purple-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/에흐로때디/\">Aphrodite (Αφροδίτη)</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-vivid-cyan-blue-to-vivid-purple-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/手捧一杯酒/\"><span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\"><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">手捧一杯酒</span><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">Chiù phang-jit-puē-jiù</span></span></a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Popular Classics</h3>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-luminous-dusk-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/家後/\"><span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\"><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">家後</span><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">Kē-āu</span></span></a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-luminous-dusk-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/堅持/\"><span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\"><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">堅持</span><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">Kiēn-chí</span></span></a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-luminous-dusk-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/꽈問天/\"><span sty